---
import Divider from './Divider.astro';
import Hero from './Hero.astro';
---
<Divider
  id="sec-3"
  section="III · 2025 Headlines"
  num="Section III"
  title="2025 Headlines"
  bg="images/olive-harvest.jpg"
/>

<section class="statband section" data-section="III · 2025 Headlines">
  <div class="wide" style="padding-inline:0">
    <div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.6rem">III · 2025 Headlines</p></div>
    <div class="statgrid reveal">
      <div class="cell"><div class="num">€35M</div><div class="lab">Total assets under management</div></div>
      <div class="cell"><div class="num">+45%</div><div class="lab">Increase in Soil Organic Carbon</div></div>
      <div class="cell"><div class="num">−59%</div><div class="lab">Reduction in herbicide use</div></div>
      <div class="cell"><div class="num">883 ha</div><div class="lab">Total land under management</div></div>
      <div class="cell"><div class="num">20%</div><div class="lab">Of land primarily managed for biodiversity &amp; nature restoration</div></div>
      <div class="cell"><div class="num">100%</div><div class="lab">Of the fund's capital invested in rural areas of Portugal</div></div>
      <div class="cell"><div class="num">940,672</div><div class="lab">Total trees planted by units of the fund</div></div>
      <div class="cell"><div class="num">1,281,571 kg</div><div class="lab">Olives harvested on our farms in 2025</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<Hero section="III · 2025 Headlines" bg="images/reveal-soc.jpg">
  <div class="kicker">Headline · Soil</div>
  <div class="stat">+45%</div>
  <h3>more soil organic carbon.</h3>
  <p>Rebuilding the carbon that decades of intensive tillage stripped out of the ground.</p>
</Hero>

<Hero section="III · 2025 Headlines" light bg="images/reveal-herbicide.jpg" bgStyle="opacity:0.5;right:0;left:auto;width:55%">
  <div class="kicker">Headline · Biodiversity</div>
  <div class="stat">−59%</div>
  <h3>less herbicide.</h3>
  <p>The 2030 target was a 30% reduction. We are already comfortably beyond it.</p>
</Hero>

<Hero section="III · 2025 Headlines" bg="images/reveal-trees.jpg">
  <div class="kicker">Headline · Climate</div>
  <div class="stat">940,672</div>
  <h3>trees in the ground.</h3>
  <p>Planted by units of the fund.</p>
</Hero>

<Hero section="III · 2025 Headlines" light bg="images/reveal-hectares.jpg" bgStyle="opacity:0.5;right:0;left:auto;width:55%">
  <div class="kicker">Headline · Portfolio</div>
  <div class="stat">883 ha</div>
  <h3>under our care.</h3>
  <p>Across two properties in the Alentejo and Centro regions of Portugal.</p>
</Hero>
